{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50663","headline":"浣花亭陪川主王播相公暨寮同赋早菊 · 薛涛","name":"浣花亭陪川主王播相公暨寮同赋早菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西陆行终令，东篱始再阳。\n绿英初濯露，金蘂半含霜。\n自有兼材用，那同衆草芳。\n献酬樽俎外，宁有惧豺狼。\n（以上二诗见《分门纂类唐歌诗》残本第六册《草木虫鱼类》卷五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛涛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50663.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50663","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}